# The written type lets both fields be left out, as every field of a program without types may be. The one maker in sight gives both (LinkedCell::isOfBirth), so a look at the slot is likely to find it filled, outside of loops too:
# the look, the load, and the read as written where the look fails. Unseen code takes one of them away between the calls.
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK: = IsSlotFilled {{*}}key="price"
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}}key="price"
# CHECK: = IsSlotFilled {{*}}key="count"
# CHECK: = PropGet {{*}}key="price"
# CHECK: = GetSlot {{*}}key="count"
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
# ANSWERS: 6 8
# ANSWERS: NaN
